arallel new sensory dimension.\n\nFeaturing music by Carbon Based Lifeforms.", "short_description": "Fantasynth 2 is an ongoing exploration of the emotional and perceptual effects of procedurally generated visuals synchronized to music.\n\nThis installment of the series focuses on building a walkable virtual space anchored in reality but evolving with the music, intersecting with the real space like a parallel new sensory dimension.\n\nFeaturing music by Carbon Based Lifeforms."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://helloenjoy.com/legal", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "HelloEnjoy", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://helloenjoy.com/fantasynth", "category": "ENTERTAINMENT", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "726368587961803"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["MUSIC"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "367144921564366"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "535152131327173"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "535152131327173"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1650910200, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "535152131327173"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "5247465958701446", "version": "0.15"}, "id": "233129194995841", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBi